#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.audiotube.appdata.xml:132
msgid "AudioTube can search YouTube Music, list albums and artists, play automatically generated playlists, albums and allows to put your own playlist together. It is adapted to mobile phones and desktop computers."
msgstr "AudioTube može pretraživati YouTube Music, prikazivati albume i izvođače te reproducirati automatski generirane popise za reprodukciju i albume, a omogućuje i sastavljanje vlastitih popisa za reprodukciju. Prilagođen je mobilnim telefonima i stolnim računalima."
